# .gitignore for the Clear English Bible repo (ceb-push)
# The audio/ rule predates this file's expansion and is retained.
# The path rules below were applied 2026-11-24 under Robert Tilford's
# seating-and-cleanup ruling of 2026-11-24, in the same commit that
# removed the 720 working files swept in by the Wave 31 `git add -A`
# commit (08042d8) from the public shelf (the files remain on disk).
# Source draft: ~/workspace/.tools/ceb-gitignore-draft.txt, prepared
# with the sensitivity audit of the 720 swept files (verdict ALL CLEAR).

audio/

# --- Desk working trees (the swept paths) ---
/fix-pass/
/sealed-pre-landing/
/index/

# --- Edition backups (swept as editions/*.bak-2026-11-09-pre-decision3) ---
*.bak-*
*.bak

# --- Python bytecode (swept as fix-pass/__pycache__/*.pyc) ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Desk working papers at repo root (swept; audited 2026-11-24) ---
/EDITION-BUILDOUTS.md
/TORAH-AUDIT-DRAFT-*.md
/JAMAICAN-PILOT-GATE-CHECK-*.md
